    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_009:f10fcd11",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "key": "011_01_009",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_009:f10fcd11",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_009:f10fcd11",
        "jp_sha256": "bbc0792d858ec91793e66b6ef59f2d5fbd93f1cb652d2a3c5a64ee7e95b8cb1e",
        "official_en_sha256": "86864fe59de92c81da7444fb5b8990eb9944d5870a86a393b32647f3c6e877a4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それには何か理由があると、俺はずっと思っていた。",
        "official_en": "I’m sure there was a reason for his silence.",
        "real_en": "I’ve always thought he must have had a reason."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "ラスウェル",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0003",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C01_011_01/011_01_009"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_008:b5ef358d",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "key": "011_01_008",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_008:b5ef358d",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_008:b5ef358d",
        "jp_sha256": "a774b9b1e89137526c6b003ab979064110b079c0df2588c3a8e9a904b11f3c7a",
        "official_en_sha256": "1491bf35ec92ba12b58fa85f39c64af8214f394dcc2e24b75bb7996e7a9635d5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なんかの調査だって言っては、フラフラと旅に出てばかり。\r\nあげくの果てに黙っていなくなって……。",
        "official_en": "He’d always be off gallivanting across the realm, saying he had to look into something. Until finally, he left without a word.",
        "real_en": "He was always off traveling, saying he had something to investigate. Then he just disappeared without a word..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
