      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_012:5a0916d5",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "key": "011_01_012",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_012:5a0916d5",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_012:5a0916d5",
        "jp_sha256": "8c5e1aeb6da1ba83ff9204f77dae9d42083e5611924fe345bf36b8297363f0ab",
        "official_en_sha256": "91d05b73a69fd99c571b17f499a9b688dde08e284171469db38546d572109c6b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "クリスタルが脅かされるようなことがあれば\r\nこの鍵を使うように……。\r\nそう、レーゲンさんに渡されたんだ。",
        "official_en": "Sir Raegen gave it to me...said to use it if any harm should come to the Crystals.",
        "real_en": "Raegen-san gave me this key and told me to use it if anything ever threatened the Crystals."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "ラスウェル",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0003",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C01_011_01/011_01_012"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_006:6c196351",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "key": "011_01_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_006:6c196351",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_006:6c196351",
        "jp_sha256": "f4a4fd6a3d64ef8617c011147d3cc16799080d9fd9dd375527f3ab5a60ecc8d0",
        "official_en_sha256": "3aad50d31d4d022c5fa3b38a46561e8f0c4dbde608354db62df358861410995e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "グランシェルト騎士団の中でも\r\nレーゲンさんは特に陛下の信頼が厚かったというのに。",
        "official_en": "Of all his loyal retainers, His Majesty trusted your father the most.",
        "real_en": "Even among Grandshelt’s knights, Raegen-san had earned His Majesty’s particular trust..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "ラスウェル",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0003",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C01_011_01/011_01_006"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_004:25c04d10",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "key": "011_01_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_004:25c04d10",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_004:25c04d10",
        "jp_sha256": "e55d3055a2b77fcc3c6737cba87a0a75450433d24b2c9c43421c0bcaf82d3b82",
        "official_en_sha256": "965cb4861ae4f195338c9551db3a40861f92047b65ac5af40edf2f48cd037c1a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レーゲンさんのことを\r\nあいつなんて呼ぶんじゃない。\r\n自分の父親じゃないか。",
        "official_en": "You shouldn’t call him that. Sir Raegen was your father, and he did a lot for us.",
        "real_en": "Don’t call Raegen-san “that guy.” He’s your own father."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "ラスウェル",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0003",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C01_011_01/011_01_004"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_014:41ed5371",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "key": "011_01_014",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_014:41ed5371",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_011_01:011_01_014:41ed5371",
        "jp_sha256": "a6f6a9fbd83981e326c2ab2f2ad57aa97284a3878ad914bfc308373ec50f2d85",
        "official_en_sha256": "4462587adc906fa2a3c8acc6616285a819013b918c0c200a1acc19f1852728bc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "今回の事態が起こることを\r\nレーゲンさんは予測していたのかもしれない。",
        "official_en": "I think he knew this was going to happen.",
        "real_en": "Maybe Raegen-san foresaw what was going to happen."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_011_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
